{
  "title": "Destiny 2 — Fate Saga (2025–present)",
  "date": "10-28",
  "text": "Following The Final Shape, Bungie moved into a long-term story called the Fate Saga, which began with the Year of Prophecy expansions. Instead of four seasons as in past expansions, Bungie plans to offer two mid-sized expansions, along with a free seasonal content update within each expansion. The first expansion, The Edge of Fate, launched in July 2025, and features the Guardians traveling to the planet Kepler with the Sol system's Oort Cloud, which involves the Nine. The next expansion, Renegades, launched in December 2025, and themed around concepts from Star Wars, a significant influence on Destiny's design, and includes crossover Star Wars elements into Destiny.",
